<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BrookTrout cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BrookTrout cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has downgraded its recommendation for Broooktrout Technology Inc to hold from buy, a Prudential source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 40-1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
